<!-- From: http://www.w3.org/TR/rdf-sparql-query/#grammar 
  The entities implement productions [95] (PN_CHARS_BASE), [96] (PN_CHARS_U), [98] (PN_CHARS), [99] (PN_PREFIX),
  [100] (PN_LOCAL), [71] (PNAME_NS), [72] (PNAME_LN) and  [68] (PrefixedName)
  
